	(lib_symbols)
	(text "Power: 5V in → TPS79901 3V3 LDO; LM27762 ±3V7; APD bias block (replaces the former MAX15032 6.5–15 V photodiode bias): programmable,\\ntemperature-compensated, low-noise 100–220 V supply on rail APD_BIAS (HV), 5V in; IC/module TBD, options pending in docs/research/apd-bias-supply.md.\\nHV constraints: 200 V creepage/clearance, series current limit, guard and keep-out from TIA_IN, HV warning silk. 5V_A filtered analog rail. PROPOSED; supply UNRESOLVED."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
